:''Not to be confused with the [[Worker Cat]] or the [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]].''
'''Rich Cat III''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] loses multi-hit and greatly increases his attack power, along with gaining another [[Cat Combo]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is only available when rolling in either [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] (SEA) or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] (JP/WW) banners.

